## Admin Audit Logs

### List Audit Logs

Returns admin activity audit logs with comprehensive filtering.

**Endpoint:** `GET /api/superadmin/admin/audit-logs`

**Query Parameters:**
| Parameter | Type | Description |
|-----------|------|-------------|
| `adminId` | string | Filter by admin user ID |
| `actionType` | string | Filter by action type (login, logout, update, delete, etc.) |
| `resourceType` | string | Filter by resource type (user, organization, settings, etc.) |
| `status` | string | Filter by status (success, failure, warning) |
| `fromDate` | string | Start date (ISO 8601) |
| `toDate` | string | End date (ISO 8601) |
| `riskLevel` | string | Filter by risk level (low, medium, high, critical) |
| `limit` | number | Max results (default: 100) |
| `offset` | number | Pagination offset |

**Response:**
```json
{
    "logs": [
        {
            "id": "log-uuid-123",
            "adminId": "admin-uuid-456",
            "actionType": "update",
            "resourceType": "organization",
            "resourceId": "org-uuid-789",
            "description": "Updated organization settings",
            "details": {
                "field": "name",
                "oldValue": "Old Corp",
                "newValue": "New Corp"
            },
            "ipAddress": "192.168.1.1",
            "userAgent": "Mozilla/5.0...",
            "riskLevel": "low",
            "status": "success",
            "createdAt": "2025-01-02T10:00:00Z",
            "admin": {
                "email": "admin@company.com",
                "firstName": "John",
                "lastName": "Admin"
            }
        }
    ],
    "total": 1523,
    "page": 1,
    "pageSize": 100
}
```

