## Permissions Matrix

### List All Permissions

Returns all defined permissions.

**Endpoint:** `GET /api/superadmin/admin/permissions`

**Response:**
```json
[
    {
        "id": "perm-uuid-123",
        "key": "organizations:read",
        "description": "View organizations",
        "category": "organizations",
        "isSystem": true,
        "createdAt": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z"
    }
]
```

---

### Get Permissions Matrix

Returns the complete permissions matrix mapping roles to permissions.

**Endpoint:** `GET /api/superadmin/admin/permissions/matrix`

**Response:**
```json
{
    "categories": [
        {
            "id": "organizations",
            "name": "Organizations",
            "permissions": [
                {
