### Create Permission

Creates a new permission.

**Endpoint:** `POST /api/superadmin/admin/permissions`

**Request Body:**
```json
{
    "key": "custom:feature:access",
    "description": "Access to custom feature",
    "category": "custom"
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
    "id": "perm-uuid-new",
    "key": "custom:feature:access",
    "description": "Access to custom feature",
    "category": "custom",
    "isSystem": false,
    "createdAt": "2025-01-02T10:00:00Z"
}
```

---

### Update Role Permissions

Updates permissions assigned to a role.

**Endpoint:** `PUT /api/superadmin/admin/permissions/roles/:roleId`

**Request Body:**
```json
{
    "permissions": [
        "organizations:read",
        "organizations:write",
        "users:read"
    ]
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
    "success": true,
    "message": "Role permissions updated",
    "role": {
        "id": "role-admin",
        "name": "Administrator",
        "permissions": ["organizations:read", "organizations:write", "users:read"]
    }
}
```

