## Approval Workflows

### List Approval Workflows

Returns all defined approval workflows.

**Endpoint:** `GET /api/superadmin/admin/approval-workflows`

**Response:**
```json
[
    {
        "id": "wf-uuid-123",
        "name": "Organization Deletion",
        "description": "Requires approval for deleting organizations",
        "resourceType": "organization",
        "action": "delete",
        "isActive": true,
        "requiresMfa": true,
        "minApprovers": 2,
        "approvers": [
            {
                "userId": "admin-uuid-456",
                "email": "admin@company.com",
                "role": "owner"
            }
        ],
        "createdAt": "2025-01-01T00:00:00Z",
        "updatedAt": "2025-01-02T10:00:00Z"
    }
]
```

---

### Create Approval Workflow

Creates a new approval workflow.

**Endpoint:** `POST /api/superadmin/admin/approval-workflows`

**Request Body:**
```json
{
    "name": "High-Value Contract Approval",
    "description": "Requires approval for contracts over $100k",
    "resourceType": "contract",
    "action": "create",
    "isActive": true,
    "requiresMfa": true,
    "minApprovers": 2,
    "conditions": {
        "field": "value",
        "operator": "gte",
        "value": 100000
    },
    "approvers": ["admin-uuid-456", "admin-uuid-789"]
}
```

**Response:**
```json
{
    "id": "wf-uuid-new",
    "name": "High-Value Contract Approval",
    "...": "..."
}
```

---

### Update Approval Workflow

Updates an existing approval workflow.

**Endpoint:** `PUT /api/superadmin/admin/approval-workflows/:id`

**Request Body:**
```json
